{"message":"Money pool activity used $42.5 million of operating cash flows in 2004, while receivables from the money pool at the end of 2004 were $61,592 thousand ($61.592 million). Thus, $42.5 million / $61.592 million ≈ 69.0%.","final":{"answer":"69.0%","value":69.0,"unit":"percent","sources":["source:q0n0","source:t2c0n0"],"result_id":"tool:1"}}